023-01-19T23:30:37.421705Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Pascal Petitjean\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRQntbbGio3afttVF-xTi0AxiQm7bWEP5vmMDaRiOqZwL96lH-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:48:\"Super friendly, welcoming staff.  really perfect\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-16T23:58:05.467612Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"keizer kz\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJl9OHjCgpKL3H115VB4pIxhPVuoFMNIjQ5PnOSl6PIYUZ3Zw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:222:\"I usually give Chicken Star 5 stars, but at this branch in Balibago, their gravy is always thin and fatty. I\'ve bought here 4 to 5 times and it\'s always really thin. I\'ll only change it to 5 stars when their gravy is good.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-21T16:18:23.627285Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Rowel Pamintuan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWO9x3CH-j_qIUL-C6CALzrRKj8NGfmL8qZJnwSLZb2su3dZNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:144:\"I ordered it yesterday for my Grandma\'s bday? it\'s so worth the 235, it\'s so delicious! It\'s perfect, perfect!?? I\'ll make it again?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-10-11T22:31:07.160005Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:8;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE\";s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Chicken Star\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.165768;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.58326369999999;s:7:\"address\";s:51:\"950 Fields Ave, Angeles, 2009 Pampanga, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJi3FYc5zzljMR360tbn9KUDE/photos/AVoNoXStA66vO2yC2YgtGIwmtrpaUsb4Jq0y3fU_sc9TPw8BbNV5EEAWf0