:\"text\";s:69:\"The food really taste good. Specially the sisig and chicken. Love it!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-07-30T06:22:12.774616Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"roger africa\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUCrpNw5SkHlHLv9IGrE7NLNYxqHhxVbnug0w-5DwlVV3qwKGD5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:254:\"This restaurant is a no nonsense eatery. Very sumptous menus but you have to be early for lunch para di maubusan. Grilled hito, pork bbqs, chicken bbqs, talong ensalada option inihaw na talong w/ bagoong. Friendly priced and they accept senior discounts.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-08-25T21:33:54.339278Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Oliver Gil Beltran\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWl5wC9QkdsRMb6fFiT-mWOK03NH2H9ydlDJ4K3UyDM8NRR77OF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:214:\"They have the best sisig ever. The authentic sisig kapampangan. Not the sizzling with an egg on top style.\n\nTheir lechon manok is also better than the other more popular brands that people in the Metro are used to.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2018-09-13T16:47:29.514415Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ-ZzTGQDPljMRS98eiFXc6UU\";s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Kuya bob Pares\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.553750099999997;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.6723177;s:7:\"address\";s:52:\"HM3C+GW4, San Jacinto, Victoria, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Alpie S. Gadores\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXh2q2LBYo7W01CGSYvpgYspPXPFsCeyzn3MuBiNLruYKrjf0T3=s128-c0x0000