tamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-14T10:08:01.408211632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"christian tolentino\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQWm04KVR0CAbsqVn3zr3LWV1EVEfDN70ce-N22vEmKCr41329=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:111:\"The view is okay relaxing. Food is also okay. Good for a short family outing pampawala ng stress. Nature vibes.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-22T17:41:50.799693120Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:20:\"Verity Wilson-Ganela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXpfH3mCAJDs3J1x54F56VgXmRWQ1BDvB3LHqmA-2_cJXdlyJCErQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:137:\"Great range of street food all cooked in front of you. Amazing views of the mountains. Mother Nature even put on a light show (lighting).\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-05T00:49:38.451845736Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:5;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJAQAAud95vTMRmkC--MNLub0\";s:4:\"name\";s:30:\"VIEWPOINT By Cerilos est. 1992\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.0881128;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.90598019999999;s:7:\"address\";s:95:\"Km. 64 Emilio Aguinaldo Highway, Barangay Bagong Tubig, Tagaytay City, 4120 Cavite, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:422;s:7:\"reviews\";i:422;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJAQAAud95vTMRmkC--MNLub0/photos/AVoNoXQi8R5szkuNssrWkcTZNS06ImsyqlLYlgstvchmucRqI31JWe6_IMYejpq2wRjA9RLgVV52aJ6JCOh3Of_00jrCUkdJ_hjSzD50mgXHXwozORfptnFHXpU-JICW2V77pVG7tVdx4o669Wh7lRrIdj_lXw2-uXTThbRNhknb0tw-MABBs3nCtCXShPfLYh10zqOmVA0D6Edfvi_NuBP0VHyEnARGdxqTZeVdkWSiOJbGfx716M1Tiu7_eFNQRG1RgkHtiDG5k-27o4HApbcoV_yr6ZoH3uMuyM_mLwbk_MV7t0CTl86o2WkIWqYWQZDgP3M0c0MQYKmhnAF6DuWr8ZRXHLQKhglnF9XQWQZZ_AzU8HhsCzCLQWuGZbWR-og0Are1ZMwUg7W_aSHlPNCJXmN8o2dC-WQ8s8pzdQqtwW