dqErKeB7Jz8GewhCeyizbIqmhNZ4GZXZY-_U4g1ECuON0PxQo3Ny-YilJVHZGjOO8MNYToqpZu9AOhq_v3bjFGtbqdd_dVrxQuksJU2GvQLvxX_2GmKRKdh4O2T7F78GwaXmw\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJAQAAud95vTMRmkC--MNLub0/photos/AVoNoXT6MzPy71G964Rsk0wmcGHcww8WluUmafxYIM2YrnXlM7mJTNtdKoefZvr_2g8i4H57L0HlHW7pi32-0Q8dEnNXkP7FXlNcr7EGAz1iRaE07spyI77YeBgRyuzPz31D7TB8pn1uN3WxN7woCC46zCIEG8gi22uUSC4M736YC1DGd2th2v1x0Yz05mIawDD0kKhG2OQOYKfJaZMVZ5t8F9yVERsc-On1pcSt_xdfoKo6SzFa43mg6fK29oKxOQsDQlw6jw4uhNN1pgqCt4Cla02BYAkfED-ZENUII1aMloW7YapheClkewVy-RyrYUojuF8dUh14gsY1XobYxAKTYTwimezuO61AR60_sg6CvGegfsLxfTLLdAD08PvfUZOR1pqEVKpDLMbIPsAl95fbnDjvD9jUdqPJsk4bxCi7UygNiLDvpZECrlQnh_cwvcOs\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Frances Abellera\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgV0ZQ3tT69WbUXlmAbtbg5xFNApp6JXct-ZpT7XzLNRy9IqWX=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:986:\"Had an amazing experience at Viewpoint by Cerilos! Food and service were honestly 10/10. It seems like the new management has completely turned things around.\n\nEverything we ordered was superb — the binagoongan, kare-kare, tokwa’t baboy, crispy tadyang, and salted egg shrimp were all incredibly flavorful and well-served. Sulit na sulit because the portions are very generous too. We’ve already been here twice, and we’re even planning to come back again next week!\n\nWhat makes the experience even better is the breathtaking view — seriously, pictures don’t do it justice. The ambiance alone is worth the visit. The general manager was also very kind, accommodating, and humble. He even offered to take our photos and gave us a little tour around the area, which made the whole experience feel extra warm and welcoming.\n\nOverall, this place deserves more recognition. Definitely one of the most underrated restaurants in Tagaytay and 100% a must-try. Easily a 12/10 for us!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-10T15:28:10.353911496Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jasmin Suguitan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIw2OfkVplKoXop2d13b9q7rbOSKfVrl-Fz1CzrH9xRWbNVLA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:469:\"Super perfect talaga I can say na it\'s truly a exceptional staycation plus dining experience. Biruin mo From the moment we arrived, the service was seamless and attentive without being intrusive. The furniture and interior design are clearly well-curated, blending comfort with a high-end aesthetic. the view is absolutely breathtaking providing the perfect backdrop for a memorable evening. Highly recommended for anyone seeking quality and elegance plus view of couse\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-11T05:04:03.722922763Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Karen Baldomero\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTb9_so3THBCEI1IRdgKCV8K3fuCzuqIqmqMI5jOqo7I7zYA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:265:\"Highly recommended!\n\nThe food was delicious, and the place offers a magnificent view of Taal. Prices are very affordable, making the experience even more worthwhile. As a bonus, the owner is very friendly and accommodating, which made our visit even more enjoyable.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-21T08:00:15.314369259Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"MAJ MAGOS PAF\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWI7twfplQTSSEphkbmyu_-Z2z7Md2sP1MjhGhZ3cJZeNX8I6Vh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:110:\"We ate dinner at their restaurant. The food was good. The price was just fair. Thank you for the good service.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-12T09:09:05.057958948Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Rio Hernandez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ5ZOZ_XGt6XqbHG6Hs271oFPKi7NoW1EzQYDkFNkcITsJauA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"