sonnel collecting an environmental fee.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-09T15:04:32.306285225Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:24:\"Roxanne Joy Diaz (Roxie)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMCi0OvvEgJGw0sSvtSXdn2IQlCYjkeq8wuuEaBt6bPxEfsH2L=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"I stayed in Aninuan and on my way to White Beach I came across this overlooking viewpoint. You can see White Beach in its entirety. Of course i had to stop and take a snap. ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-12T05:36:26.516788585Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Michael Allen Celestial\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1DDMoi9p6f7LL7E7l_xuuTm36N6oWEOFVoR2iBaqxISvf1M6K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:73:\"You can utilize the nearby shortcut from Playa Blanca to the White Beach.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-27T07:49:56.910391Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Traveling Man\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3d8mAJgymQGI1bR8b4rFz_LoJgDvz1KN-9PqQtyqftucheVOp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"Gotta luv it with birds eye view of White Beach\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-11-03T01:21:18.259008Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Waldo Smyth\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQrX1yVRwAObM21MRvlH_PD59oWnWU0JuBzOYekYijd6QK7zE7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:288:\"Nice place to enjoy the view over White Beach and stairs down to the beach. And it is free. You won\'t get harassed by people trying to sell things.\nOnly downside: traffic right behind you and at times idling cars with silly tourists who stop, roll down their windows to get that snapshot.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-11-21T07:55:47.599045Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1788935151),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_59e744d6fa396b357528bc8cf03e390d_15.523_120.421','a:20:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0\";s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"Viewpoint – Monasterio de Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.436714199999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4303286;s:7:\"address\";s:48:\"CCPJ+M4P, Lubigan, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXRT6gElYZebf-dNEG6kZQoCOqiHA3dB_kJfvusVnl2auqOdLB12P22sv5GJxyDeEVxnbRioPz4lGHeBaylE-mAWV1c5BfOLAR7YHc3KePqn_gq1BFnijFXxaoCNM1uI7Bwt1kAh0PNoWwDt7kpvWPVxPQG4nIE7Q6_5JxV4SHCTeZP6_-0eJD8S_mKmB4E8VhNgcFNhNuEmwXj0qJBnBkEqxo_xykGRdcI4EaQgbPTW7bVNzGagBFT4p6xE16gzNZ8hf0sbKgIzy6YRrd-Z0eAqIEFJuHEo_uCNQhO1J6BmYtbMvadTRUPFMEPzk34ONbWspPMmcmiXNrIkF-jLh8HvfMmKNez326HfGcRaXSu49TVAEQblVKDb5Tp9w1jDFTM7CHzDZlH0tqZhIsApQimV6HrQB8hmHEkilHtQjGLo_JbzgtkhJ1EmoOg2gEUO\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXRT6gElYZebf-dNEG6kZQoCOqiHA3dB_kJfvusVnl2auqOdLB12P22sv5GJxyDeEVxnbRioPz4lGHeBaylE-mAWV1c5BfOLAR7YHc3KePqn_gq1BFnijFXxaoCNM1uI7Bwt1kAh0PNoWwDt7kpvWPVxPQG4nIE7Q6_5JxV4SHCTeZP6_-0eJD8S_mKmB4E8VhNgcFNhNuEmwXj0qJBnBkEqxo_xykGRdcI4EaQgbPTW7bVNzGagBFT4p6xE16gzNZ8hf0sbKgIzy6YRrd-Z0eAqIEFJuHEo_uCNQhO1J6BmYtbMvadTRUPFMEPzk34ONbWspPMmcmiXNrIkF-jLh8HvfMmKNez326HfGcRaXSu49TVAEQblVKDb5Tp9w1jDFTM7CHzDZlH0tqZhIsApQimV6HrQB8hmHEkilHtQjGLo_JbzgtkhJ1EmoOg2gEUO\";i:1;s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXQNbMYKAm2F6DQ8Ukeo9doL0nF8KubQPuqn5KUxmvTqZTKAKtaWZv7svaoZjhkoNmJy5FbZ6G62K5xDJBEapBjLdXxIUiHdKm1WTccLEUjEyVu_iv1sge663zSDV0nrnSWcmt4PA2oQQen6AuQAyBlHe7OeIzGIyLutjTj0FAmLZbUmn9ibuilCzq8mdVHQPr3ObzRlCDgZTO-6aQXHc0ioGqGU6DPlv5ERBChnlTZOzzZHinfaxaE8799f1okJ2w-DuzV70e1yzw-XQ3KIhndlXyP6jM-nMp0J