nli kape is good too! May mga pasalubong din sila. And the best part? The view.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-04-01T10:56:59.416528Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jannine Vasquez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPgVSrjchzI2LDXZMqr0RgaQfsHVm6nNTF3qTXWWlf1w_8CExDbQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Food was delicious, served hot (perfect for the cold weather), and had generous serving! Unli brewed coffee tasted great as well!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-29T11:50:33.118033Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"st ooo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUUw_L9ewldoB6JruArVR2kDQyoxTq2yMcRwg_KnGFBkrEbA94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"crazy how you can even see itogon from here?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-13T10:06:15.067802355Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Erwin Deleña\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcsvGlRF70pz2pHUft2mguMEK1bKQk2FrB98UDCm0Qdlr7kqo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-06T01:06:41.207667777Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:13;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJk2p2YgD7lzMRLk8HBYwE3JU\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Caliraya Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.3073129;s:3:\"lng\";d:121.48029159999999;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"8F4J+W4, Lumban, Laguna, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:15;s:7:\"reviews\";i:15;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJk2p2YgD7lzMRLk8HBYwE3JU/photos/AVoNoXSTNg9GIVeskF2vqDQLtJgXlpfzAV2M-262uBKn9a191buPrJhc2_JadM80LwhiXAEfavg613LoloGhyESlAOnO6skOtD3OHZ-S5C6fzo8eqJvA_g7DyXmCgK2J5k9xUry_UloVT3d-jh2c3AQxHmS1IxjdSR5N6a-Qzct87PPc6w2nOiyEYs2