-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:124:\"The store was in quite great place for some overview, the place is clean but not well organized for its picture taking place\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-09-02T14:51:19.960913Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Willie Ambrosio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJG937gIJPGNWPAVzdulbXaWkntXyy48rnMXiatUXn405KEkA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:39:\"The malico viewpoint is very beautiful.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-13T21:32:00.909950Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"lezlie reyes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXC-Ziit7PaUc_lg62ffRhYoNDca9KLB1BG-S-FgWhMv1qjggw-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:94:\"Love the view!! Plus it was so cold when we passed by here, you can also buy vegetables ♥️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-10T21:32:25.154957915Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"relly radima\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuFKzKsSdRFD0Kb9fzHPud5urO9UcL0qSVik2xtgQOt4Bx4g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-08-08T23:11:27.927716Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:18;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ718mudQDkTMRfxZIrShQFsM\";s:4:\"name\";s:22:\"Malico Viewpoint Store\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.1736276;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.86334469999998;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.6;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:24;s:7:\"reviews\";i:24;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJ718mudQDkTMRfxZIrShQFsM/photos/AVoNoXTKams7Tp0OqT53G57zGDVuTb9V1BTYTBJDC8rOwnPBXpDErUc5hRRLdiavBERCG6ZD6fWY1H0yDUg8bBC5uzc70W1GTPj1Bbmws1KJ1zeycFIh6yHKAGghFAC1MZaBTZYLf-ZmA