p-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"I stayed in Aninuan and on my way to White Beach I came across this overlooking viewpoint. You can see White Beach in its entirety. Of course i had to stop and take a snap. ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-09-12T05:36:26.516788585Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:23:\"Michael Allen Celestial\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1DDMoi9p6f7LL7E7l_xuuTm36N6oWEOFVoR2iBaqxISvf1M6K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:73:\"You can utilize the nearby shortcut from Playa Blanca to the White Beach.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-27T07:49:56.910391Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Traveling Man\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3d8mAJgymQGI1bR8b4rFz_LoJgDvz1KN-9PqQtyqftucheVOp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"Gotta luv it with birds eye view of White Beach\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-11-03T01:21:18.259008Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Waldo Smyth\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXQrX1yVRwAObM21MRvlH_PD59oWnWU0JuBzOYekYijd6QK7zE7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:288:\"Nice place to enjoy the view over White Beach and stairs down to the beach. And it is free. You won\'t get harassed by people trying to sell things.\nOnly downside: traffic right behind you and at times idling cars with silly tourists who stop, roll down their windows to get that snapshot.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-11-21T07:55:47.599045Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789100162),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_59e744d6fa396b357528bc8cf03e390d_15.579_120.481','a:20:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0\";s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"Viewpoint – Monasterio de Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:1