eck around 7am during the weekend, noticeably there were no tourists that time. Nice place to have a bird\'s eye view of the famous zigzag road, lion\'s head and vehicles traversing the mountainous landscape at the view deck. It was indeed a wonderful spot to see the rays of sunlight shedding light on the dark side of mountains. The place is not swarmed by tourists unlike the lion\'s head. If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:10;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Sadjatan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4764017;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.56095810000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FHG6+H98, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:33;s:7:\"reviews\";i:33;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQ43M7MqU-RyNcZ8u0F7jaJcqeshkPvKe_mhx5TEzrjVry1MML67a5Iz9rsIymLu9yPBNn6Sjm3h6CiOQVL3iQ40qWV3hv10efrO0OXT6uLope5-Sux9ximhwsPw0m4M-86EZ4fvydi6Pnj50-AhPFj5UN0nB46AtR52vZz6CfSM0D3HRIMvTBm2IDAx8SL_SkqtXZjPT1Ar36cujokDBxJPPB_FXzXXGe3bS--gKsxikbB6RL9-Sqi0G9Hyogx_mPBWzId8F9-oEFX-wmzgFte4DjCCZbccosWYvZRRnPZN4V4SM083cznuDhbsezYBQWWeeSlLH-eKvvS6mg6NGAnm3lx05kNmqQwynjRFgcY6kyg_RN2Ha80u-I0kF1MP-OD6-GZqqPTWBfae_xEeEK_1G1kJmDuMXAYQlRNVXgVMw\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXQ43M7MqU-RyNcZ8u0F7jaJcqeshkPvKe_mhx5TEzrjVry1MML67a5Iz9rsIymLu9yPBNn6Sjm3h6CiOQVL3iQ40qWV3hv10efrO0OXT6uLope5-Sux9ximhwsPw0m4M-86EZ4fvydi6Pnj50-AhPFj5UN0nB46AtR52vZz6CfSM0D3HRIMvTBm2IDAx8SL_SkqtXZjPT1Ar36cujokDBxJPPB_FXzXXGe3bS--gKsxikbB6RL9-Sqi0G9Hyogx_mPBWzId8F9-oEFX-wmzgFte4DjCCZbccosWYvZRRnPZN4V4SM083cznuDhbsezYBQWWeeSlLH-eKvvS6mg6NGAnm3lx05kNmqQwynjRFgcY6kyg_RN2Ha80u-I0kF1MP-OD6-GZqqPTWBfae_xEeEK_1G1kJmDuMXAYQlRNVXgVMw\";i:1;s:473:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOj