gQeywb2Mna-9b8\";i:5;s:492:\"places/ChIJS08qDAA_kDMRsI7jN7AgsFg/photos/AVoNoXS1BbJe_HvHeVrrjMw_QUWqR-CGQ4KGnB9Zx9ygz0qNzYlFLpCZyxrprBnV_BnMIevujmp5Tn28AMlGqxedg-SFKrizz7izm2-xtmfu5Em91zWAzgitUEgpvrGx4eSoBWVPOgNr0ITEVyxVjEUH__wqgQwpP320QkFXupFbPogCgp6CS24Lj8QU4nfOaQvD8W9Jf5vE-j1GCc74Oiyv_TMfum_QBcStkQdr9BhJPFw8Hhc5uMT_EYM84M1qSAJ3N8QPxeYRtGqNJCPE_txQZwFLsD6z_WSQGfwZtemjdfL587it1KbjsfSHcsuQ-bjvhnhOjidFSOON99rkHxWj-IMXLr87gJwyeuwxcL3nZT6V30M6PcHShE42m-qZBF5hbi3p49zhvR1mBOcAkW03b-vwADFlyxC5ArQcFQT1JsuST8Iw-xie_jvkIPZUCw\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Dion Tan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKiXRRCfJiqBi0U8sHguh-brK9LbnuE9BcRLX2RbKDMoOQFqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:503:\"From the Solano jump off point it us quite an easy hike, most of the lower part of the trail is cemented and a vehicle can be taken through it. Up at the top there is a small store selling some foods like cup noodles and some snacks, other than that there\'s also a bathroom that looks abandoned, an altar and some tables that look out into the view. The only bad thing is that the mountain is getting deforested at quite a quick pace, also there tends to be quite a lot of people regardless of the time.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-16T08:19:15.944973255Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Martti D\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9yG8rI8dYshK6U5441LOs_sXW-f8HUMR4I5vfkmfyDDQ0-a0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:370:\"My 3rd time climbing Mt Singian, it’s a good way to start the weekend, it’s an easy chill climb, took us about 1hr from the entrance, suitable for beginners. There was no parking at the emtrance via Aggub, Solano. We just parked safely by the roadside. Trail is cemented halfway. Make sure to bring your drinks because there’s no place to buy later on in the area.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-30T22:48:23.604518896Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"Patrik Ö\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:117:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKXELB_f3xLeurYQkDkCSgSya7AlgriE-QQ8bQ8IgWux61D1iE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:130:\"Everyone is talking about climbing/hiking, we drove our motorcycle straight up without any big issues. Great view worth the visit!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-31T10:27:22.975584434Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Shane Fate\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJxKciPJ9W74dLX2mqVerhtTI0Rr1ry0--sziPkAWVlpM5IRw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:91:\"Beginner friendly hiking trial ☑️\nSuperb view ☑️\nNice place for Camping site ☑️\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-05T10:01:31.358826119Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"DALUNAG, FARES, W.\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUvkeosVF0wYM7PL-fRhy7yjehGR8Xd3B_8lid4B7wJtxWaTCap=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:29:\"Hike to see breathtaking view\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-15T02:47:25.101734260Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1787978729),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_59e744d6fa396b357528bc8cf03e390d_15.647_120.425','a:20:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0\";s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"Viewpoint – Monasterio de Tarlac\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.436714199999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4303286;s:7:\"address\";s:48:\"CCPJ+M4P, Lubigan, San Jose, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:1;s:7:\"reviews\";i:1;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJN0X9HAC9ljMRoRgabLqnpq0/photos/AVoNoXS5dZYyo15O-T42x8byluErTUj-9gmBQGA2-pqokHCXhwssFIe_MYPSbcg5VAvRVxe1933OeX05z-CtM4_DnqWMAD4jjifg7KZaDjbpbvPVhyB