6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:71:\"best experience outing this summer ? thank you for accommodating us.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-09T02:49:49.558307Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Zaldyboy Naboa\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgAikK9m9QpF_sY3XMLqCTSwG0NeG9OmFchuSjS-22Iekv2g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:51:\"Very nice place guys lets go to masangret resort...\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-14T09:45:29.828046Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Catherine Jean Boco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWNCsNEaAy6fc2bDAnlJily85ZZIlbcd7kiCVM-UzihXHi2U4m5lQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:430:\"The owner is very accommodating? , you can even hang out with the kids there catching crabs, adding to the warm and homey feels.\n\n? There is also fresh fish for sale right at the resort, so seafood goals are a must.\n? If you love activities, there is the banana boat ride that is super fun! ?‍?‍\nPerfect spot to recharge, reset and enjoy life by the sea. ✨\n#BeachLife #SeafoodGoals #BananaBoatFun #ResetModeOn\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-09T07:00:06.693789547Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:21:\"Xenia Arianna Orduela\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUes90uJwMhoeNC0_HxsKccoWu5c0zOT_TpS2WJUU9jSBpQ9o=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:91:\"The owners are very accommodating and kind. The place is quiet. You will really find peace.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-05-24T18:27:20.740409Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Khalfan Punsalan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa0VigBYWVSnel9srozX3IT3Cny1IziS24PpVsxrJY_ht6XQ5LQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-30