e the rays of sunlight shedding light on the dark side of mountains. The place is not swarmed by tourists unlike the lion\'s head. If you\'re feeling hungry the vicinity has a coffee shop called positivity cafe that offers affordable food with many choices. The coffee shop is so lovely because it has a great view of the kennon road.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-03-06T09:16:26.045136Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Emir Arnaldo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLYOHAMG-2PWf4CVmmrUp-Vsdvziq1gkhKGVTNgZMmRv3fq6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:186:\"The location and view were spectacular. The structure however, was much less so, suffering from countless years of neglect. Here\'s to hoping that a newer view deck is built in its place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-28T23:43:27.533023369Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Nico Aguilar\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdTaCsDXJKQqvtCHAco4xVLhiHUbPmvWhGskyzuKoVRIIjCWEI9g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:177:\"Very nice viewdeck of the zigzag road of Kennon. You can view the Lion\'s Head from up here. It\'s also a memorial of the Japanese and Filipinos that build the road way back then.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-17T18:56:40.213658Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"iamrrabbit\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX9S9pvCpT_9IxQrT2stQHXt-6gT_sBPt3K6EeIXoRYTFTjLI0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:68:\"Ample parking , paid CR but clean , you can buy local souvenirs here\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-23T20:35:43.771665309Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Sheryll Ico\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHUlfqdc3B07CMLFpwZ-bCOhsJjM0dWaJeDMixVk2cYtkGMZ_J_w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:92:\"Still one of those view decks to see when in Kennon Road. Awesome view on the famous zigzag!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-05T03:10:41.270183Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:4;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Sadjatan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.4764017;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.56095810000001;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"FHG6+H98, La Trinidad, Benguet, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:3:\"poi\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:33;s:7:\"reviews\";i:33;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXRQkSUKLUaPRi28xtlz4LE8gcXPT4JHkO69BUkl1jpa3BwdQtI54v7JhjWitSjYtaUW8iNwJx0lOMuE7hfBkGn-3dE3XLbT58-h8ya3vRB-otZLY7pfiRcK_bOjj6n3qkEXTDsVmM8poK75UqziINmcvNhgLntp6pEms7vN8OCWE4Dk-MWvDGjF2M6SY3a2NiPc1TLU9HqE40mMD5DgX92mVPXdbbelNAvHERkyx7HocBIp5gFQaOdaeFm2l7mjt3LWPjnR4gzkF9qBJtFmNBKeOZvUREQjISZoiguXMebrrRlBJzIZ2CAwx7L8nNzbt481J5mMkhoPEsio6Ug1vKsIpmaW5E-R55o-OFHuSpywThNRiDfwjV57lVL-ZKexJ3k2o3v8F9nrw7ptzCnvMhZUwJ9GkRON8SggrSK1EeJAbg\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXRQkSUKLUaPRi28xtlz4LE8gcXPT4JHkO69BUkl1jpa3BwdQtI54v7JhjWitSjYtaUW8iNwJx0lOMuE7hfBkGn-3dE3XLbT58-h8ya3vRB-otZLY7pfiRcK_bOjj6n3qkEXTDsVmM8poK75UqziINmcvNhgLntp6pEms7vN8OCWE4Dk-MWvDGjF2M6SY3a2NiPc1TLU9HqE40mMD5DgX92mVPXdbbelNAvHERkyx7HocBIp5gFQaOdaeFm2l7mjt3LWPjnR4gzkF9qBJtFmNBKeOZvUREQjISZoiguXMebrrRlBJzIZ2CAwx7L8nNzbt481J5mMkhoPEsio6Ug1vKsIpmaW5E-R55o-OFHuSpywThNRiDfwjV57lVL-ZKexJ3k2o3v8F9nrw7ptzCnvMhZUwJ9GkRON8SggrSK1EeJAbg\";i:1;s:473:\"places/ChIJrxMbPCOjkTMRA15Ed28P54A/photos/AVoNoXR-3K57ZOhTe6_u__oAyWHG3QNwx8LYOxcSfiEahAaJOj2OpAbKqIFHWZlxzeqKQx-j9sE4Qracs2awJlxNqKfrutnU3FueDF8nUVnOL22O1ycl4e0SAXlJhYtf2bIk4OfMMhyHGmLYO7YtcMJZSpZnDE5Tg9Oys_kJm4H0ELWOOCs-8TPyUDn0Naot1BnRG_Z3_B-BcGIQnHGCgwdYpdr9XwgGdtKMYzthB2OHyYB-