Tbf8mu2epB8VwsEUUCcXujNDvrJ6GjHhJVNZL5kcm81GBQhB8n94-6tKaumu22GBVu-5ebH1HNEP6h1Qzhq2y5DS1x2C8MnMDTuR_zhhseDMi4NWwCVeDM0CJdxATwuiFdc24TOecZ_SZlkV7883tcvKu8wN4BGGjSKKu2O61JSKVfXDMfdESHvEw\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Lyndy Baradero\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXq7MIlxs7AU8w1iXXJLgUka8tk5MhMfl1g3d6kTNi3dbAxNPeh=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:647:\"A must-visit for nature lovers and road trippers. The view is absolutely breathtaking — you can see the vast mountains, pine trees, and winding roads below. It’s especially scenic in the late afternoon when fog starts to roll in, giving the area a calm and dreamy atmosphere.\n\nThere aren’t any benches or facilities, so it’s more of a quick stop to take in the view and snap some photos. Still, it’s a peaceful and refreshing place to pause and enjoy the fresh mountain air.\n\nJust make sure to bring water and wear comfortable shoes if you’re exploring the area. A great photo spot and a perfect break during your drive through Malico!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-08-23T13:23:41.170195835Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Local Reviewer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS2Z43OHVCAMSdufou-hPZh5IQoahRIFzepXJs-GIzofQ0oMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:76:\"Good place for view also the four trees at the top. Just find a spot to view\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-11-20T12:04:57.729888Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Abigail Cushing\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPmFHNvGrH_qzXfTRncJ5w4olREui-pbOd6q5mRyPc5763UB1S=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:60:\"My 2nd time, this spot never gets out of style love it! ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-22T02:14:38.119860024Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Lunar (GAPH)\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVc0iA4RBU1qH4HBwtmBrnX1M_dRrDF5iUZRGEhXRYVIgPdRCL9lA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:90:\"This little strip of land marks the spot that you are almost near the main area of Malico.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-06T04:14:42.729922401Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Kill _phil Dito\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWunaQDL9V9k24fNXpVW-DlmTobWeKqea_MPntB3HTk8Wrvqcjy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:138:\"Great scenery and the perfect spot for taking pictures. Cool temperatures and the best twisties you\'ll find. O.M.C. view point is amazing.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-07T22:12:37.512253Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:7;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ\";s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"View Point Grill and Restaurant\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.6143836;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.36299129999998;s:7:\"address\";s:45:\"San Fernando City, 2500 La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.1;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:46;s:7:\"reviews\";i:46;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXScAIi1Ay4Eh1bxIKwTFW1wiEZSJ22tWBIhiZ8pxd7ibzqKdKnYc71isnLDWaCtxbIeWWn9Fplv1KL7yRrM8ow-kA6gI3K24RAOTSDUvYXmhyMxHfYdBQTxcEHuhAwH-X_y2XC_dRq3Cj8_tozhoJYSQ1uYto9QmQavaAjXuw4EO1IiQs5HYmgkcq_DUJnDp7uIPF5wmLE_gTfxgcNbxWYcDbIfEylxYqYo8897027DUCfv6L5KfRyV0IVoioGO1D-jg3fyP6nmUN6yjgHw38jUQMkk-ttTv_J8MmuG2v0NjotG-sUZCeyCX6rSCC47QulTXsrsJbCnGvhRUX3Xj0uEKrtuf2nkMrstr5Sb1kisvnuSUFVErgFjJBzGnC_sZxyVeogrPcDyRNh1H2FRDfa-JMeyKNoF15q3RL-L1tDynw\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:476:\"places/ChIJY0rPB8ORkTMRKLXVFMQO3aQ/photos/AVoNoXScAIi1Ay4Eh1bxIKwTFW1wiEZSJ22tWBIhiZ8pxd7ibzqKdKnYc71isnLDWaCtxbIeWWn9Fplv1KL7yRrM8ow-kA6gI3K24RAO