, loud sewer pipe above the bed.\n\nToilets and shower are gross. Toilet clogs easy so get your plunger ready. Bed is a thin pice of foam. Wifi only works when you\'re outside of the room.\n\nView is nice, that\'s it.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-07T22:58:22.370703478Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"Dastik\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW7khCsZsoudj74i-emhRJFIUndlDZmY6aE5Qu2XQ0B6lm1j_Da=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:124:\"5/5 for me got electric fan, water heater for the shower, they got bedit or tabo, the views outside the veranda is very nice\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-03-06T12:32:14.259208Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Gene Herrera\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUTuelEokKr7W3KEae2gxEF9dClRSgk-hTjTXW1dV88WnAARBfC=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:160:\"Room is fair as a transient stay. With hot and cold shower. With electric fan and electric kettle. Over-looking mountain view is the highlights during our stay.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-06-10T01:54:57.059944Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Average Gameplayss\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXUnIrdRCcK9k4AfJ0QhtXLmabEmiyJIXO_EdHguyt3T7ILi3vU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:71:\"View outside 8/10, ambiance 9/10, rooms and hall 10/10  very affordable\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-02-16T15:44:23.061575Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Ylon Permejo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1JY6b9oO3AoB5PFgCgpPZeSdlIwA3CZIMeTd9YA9YEvXWBbwJ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:41:\"The view at the veranda is breath-taking.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-06-30T08:08:50.258385Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17: