XQx0p_VkTpMPP6Lxq-imvlLa642Gx4ekplPmMhmIsiMxXxc1oEw3Vi00_wSWMotV-R3M_Ej2pDjhQBhRnfmVJvxDzJF1NP8cqg4XZwYIWVvXJyspzm8sRjFIaLRCnN7v5jTDeFhpRDck1D1UyYo9b06IVTaAX0nBOzWy1R8IE_Rl_PNC1sGNUj-3My5ew__RMs-RCFtorGMoaMUHvZ7E0tNQJawHOYWbhV1RvRkDGa4SU5DX_94-oRsLJvpLSEZUwj2VoTXeLKgZt2HQ1QIVlzpaNpRf4RKWlZ6qS6RxT3LtsEnL8PngM_tQtCzI1mFM6jS6cNqC7luvotNbtIsgYRiAUyJwI0W7VfuVv1a8ow9KoGV5u_GkfBjFVSLoC3hg5Sq-LwEXr7lsIt4Woy_-n-LSY8Vek0J2ExANA35Drq07T8-D2cdlvcxJsK1\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Local Reviewer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVS2Z43OHVCAMSdufou-hPZh5IQoahRIFzepXJs-GIzofQ0oMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:386:\"Update 5/5/25: still a nice place a must go\n\nA very nice and serene place to visit. You can access the view deck by taking the stairs, offering a beautiful vantage point. There’s a restroom below that charges ₱5 for urinating. Nearby, you’ll find a vibrant red Japanese gate adding charm to the area. The history of this location is also written for visitors to explore and learn.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-05T03:36:08.891321810Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Jeffrey Ebdani\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhrDnNTHmP2HI0w0PW43WrdmR4Y7eUd-HYCN3dT-_zHGXchVEc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:140:\"The drone view from above the view deck is immaculate. No fees as this is a view deck. Public transport such as jeep is available via sablan\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-05T14:59:29.595603442Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Yajitra Rik\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgcclZ4442fZqbpPkWv-g6owthF8ybuCgwaXWl8Eh4_5_g6rY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:227:\"It’s not exactly a tourist destination, but rather a convenient stopover for travelers along Naguilian Road in Sablan, where you can buy snacks, vegetables, pasalubong, and souvenirs, take a short break, and use the restroom.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-12-27T04:07:05.214585622Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"FacelessWanderer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKsetiXdQXvay1FVzjRPu3EjUWt4iKmV6bJn_Y5tG7gEX0Tcw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:268:\"This is along Naguillan Rd. Not busy part of the highway,mostly private vehicles were passing here. You can see the mountains on their viewing deck. There\'s some stores where you can buy food and souvenirs. There\'s also 2 food houses and restrooms if nature calls you.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-24T04:19:13.360126Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"John Stephen Gois\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJriCVHFPmU7c5eIX2qmZoQ_odbLkaosvSYm8fLJXDBoemRtiT=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:1176:\"Few years back when I was still studying at La trinidad, I have always noticed that there wasnt any of these establishments before. And that made me quite delighted to the fact that there was this kind of initiative and have such a development to this place. This adds up to the tourism and economy of the people accross cordillera region, specifically--Baguio City! During the old days, I use to think this place looks great for pictorial. And each time I rode on the bus, I wanted to take pictures to this place. Not only because of the great mountain view, but because it also showcases the south china sea! Isnt it great to take such a lovely place in one frame? Thus I was exhilirated to see that this place has been developed to this extent that they also built a viewdeck. There are nearby shops, souvenir shop, snack bars, comfort rooms and I also noticed that there are on going developments! I love the fact that they saw the potential of this place and they know how to take advantage of this. Hope the pandemic wont stop them, but at the same time, they remain secure and away from covid infections. Thats it! Happy new year everyone! Ill be back! ????\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-01-05T01:41:13.105230Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:17;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI\";s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Dar-Awan Viewpoint\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.182487;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.9187827;s:7:\"address\";s:36:\"Santa Fe, Nueva Vizcaya, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:5;s:7:\"reviews\";i:5;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:492:\"places/ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI/photos/AVoNoXR-UjIHwNF4QR8b354-ldkNWfeX7vxC2nPCrJEbQ67praYMHgKrNQ0YDZ7C9YVpLcBCMSgNI-HX_1tpCaFb2MK9P1bx1RCfqg9CxjOe6qOTMfI3y98nkP_pNV9YqQo19F5NoM0DHAX3FILarCEiUI-vwg-ffv8yxC6udDakxYZtZQLtXwJmzSHdoTxpF66V8zUN9MAGEfcDiFUA2VXU_EyEXT4N2_fGr7vQNATas_OqjzxpPA_hNdv6DOgdRvYEK1Jb2zAx19s1-U9W_lBeKaZxUpr5pU16DzwAmyzASlDwKxjKdDJAlifUnWPOnb-mC3SrIJRPjjPsfxySPL_pKY1QCp_ZrMXx5Zmx1_JX5KLa5KmHRamXT0SFK0LhJ0IF79w8G8Rui0wHsTV6WXbW6YNp_LAw8YqEiW885m8Nl55ChDTARbuHudtwd6EOfA\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:492:\"places/ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI/photos/AVoNoXR-UjIHwNF4QR8b354-ldkNWfeX7vxC2nPCrJEbQ67praYMHgKrNQ0YDZ7C9YVpLcBCMSgNI-HX_1tpCaFb2MK9P1bx1RCfqg9CxjOe6qOTMfI3y98nkP_pNV9YqQo19F5NoM0DHAX3FILarCEiUI-vwg-ffv8yxC6udDakxYZtZQLtXwJmzSHdoTxpF66V8zUN9MAGEfcDiFUA2VXU_EyEXT4N2_fGr7vQNATas_OqjzxpPA_hNdv6DOgdRvYEK1Jb2zAx19s1-U9W_lBeKaZxUpr5pU16DzwAmyzASlDwKxjKdDJAlifUnWPOnb-mC3SrIJRPjjPsfxySPL_pKY1QCp_ZrMXx5Zmx1_JX5KLa5KmHRamXT0SFK0LhJ0IF79w8G8Rui0wHsTV6WXbW6YNp_LAw8YqEiW885m8Nl55ChDTARbuHudtwd6EOfA\";i:1;s:494:\"places/ChIJCRgtcwADkTMR_ezsqj4X2JI/photos/AVoNoXTn_tx_QJdd7ZDchW4eFeJL6SrWNydHbzKI0Y3Us9HHNvo_nHaWHnr-8RXraOycLtj3WLw3ZPMokbNj3T9rz9PK26iTE4z6Iz85xL74TMCwisFf4iFMKY4ahHMx_cy-JndOsxj8JXBUkcS7UTPNbGV6rwpZ-oFdxMyjUMd4p