h0ZWGAxOesN-qi1_2bCnWpWIgJdQ64twnqwNWk8_89HgjOX5fwCV11MlzTqvqftTDmLTGEBb2H0TeOcAPboUk0L_kufj08Q\";i:5;s:494:\"places/ChIJD58YBvS90ocRQMjMYXZWzzU/photos/AVoNoXQRdX2VtVyJ6nIUHJKw_W9VKD2V1bG238K7ODUkYzoVKTS1wPTS0pozkRMPJKRDOnfTol2O4DtebXv4_gGTrNHOzadWZ7DqmfpCYEeO5OA77GM46vPiWTDXOjlSNS1FXg1-8OvUvkaR6rL-FP5DPjZ8_oNXoKO1cWEYEnkG8lLxqZ8J9pYN3NO_x8x4pyck51AEtV2TYh8tsyCAnMM0b_rV8Vsg08PHngCfkG9OA9Q9C07ajruR0ZwaK1jU1AzkmcOUyVJcPxNe5NSL6zIXAZYp5JXvfay10ajCAA97ew8s3uN_MeLwtcA5eajLMlVxoThPWhSmMucQw2w5E__OC_V11hklFDmdjM9aCpcs7EbRep20OhQ1XjuKpEDGY1RFZGzyEP7nb6a-C6Wd9RkHrzMJgusDVHM7OA-glkxUTonx28GeSswfRyVsQnGBh6v6\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Mr. M00sestachio\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV5DkKFdd7WDd59jC4yML5sbHktpUeJVtCS9G-pewbFerFpoIyp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:637:\"It’s my third time here in a week so I’m ready to write my review. First and foremost I’m from the west coast and In and Out is my burger joint of choice. Franks has brought that old school burger taste to the Little Rock area and surpassed it entirely! A double cheese burger with extra burger sauce, pickles, tomatoes, add mustard, and extra toasted buns is what’s doing it for me. ?‍??‍? extra sauce on the side for those amazing fries. Comes out to about $15 for a double combo with fries and drink. They’re friendly, attentive, and the speed they’re pumping out is amazing. 100% my new go to for burgers.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-04-23T19:24:54.693307632Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Carrie Ebling\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUm6tp1mtqFlsFH9dFG0GoyVQysLfbEbxpdG-laFD147XG4mfoW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:299:\"My hubby is from the Chicago area so I choose to stop when I saw they served a Chicago dog. He was a bit disappointed that the relish wasn\'t neon green and there were no poppy seeds on the buns, but it was great. Tried a Seattle dog for the first time and was pleasantly surprised. Will visit again.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-04T19:27:20.247465394Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Yonnae Asé\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWVrQepCIQG588oqdAaHvG-ZxdpoE1-lIqlTI79FQAZAx12PX4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:568:\"LOVE LOVE LOVE everything about this place from the food to the people to the atmosphere. My smash burger was sooooo gooooddd and that Chicago dog bayyybeee as someone who went to Chicago just for the hotdogs and I don’t even eat hotdogs they Chicago dog was fireeeee and the fries are homemade cut and fried with love ❤️\n\nWe from Cincinnati but my fiance drives trucks for maverick. And we decided to stop here and I have 0 regrets yall have to stop and EAT here! AK is nothing short of amazing and the food MWAH chief kiss we will definitely have to come back!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-06T00:45:57.743988853Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Cody Sarhan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZhCadxAp5WfFdXJHyEE0wxG-4kvUMbXIDdcUCZ2YSLjmTV2Y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:360:\"Best burger town, and it\'s not even close! Better than David\'s, Freddy\'s, and even Five Guys! We come here multiple times a week and Khalil (the skinny guy) always takes care of us. Amazing service! Always fast and friendly! We love spending our money here because the burgers are always so fresh and delicious! All for under $10 per person! Best deal in town!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-01T01:45:33.813665919Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Kris Coddington\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:116:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTzKKxBeN8yxlc4wVfu0TAztd9gLPi7AHDoykF2QX9FqzZ2A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:415:\"Alex and the Crew at FRANKS went above and beyond! From the moment we ordered to getting our drinks and sat down our food was brought fresh to the table. Alex noticed we didn’t have forks for our cheese fries and went to get some for us as we begging to dig in to the fresh burgers and homemade fries with nacho cheese. We have lived in LR for 6 years and this has truly been the best burger. Will be coming back!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-02T18:01:59.438840574Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:15;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJm2h88_PMljMRaMa0ycRsJoo\";s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Franks N\'burgers\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.623642099999998;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.6474912;s:7:\"address\";s:25:\"Pura, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:16;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJeXO0IgA5kTMRrYGJhpxg0Dg\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Franks N\' Burgers\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.8999658;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.5886958;s:7:\"address\";s:43:\"VHXQ+XFP, Villasis, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:17;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJU6YXQI8_kTMRC72sZmm0cn0\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Franks N\' Burgers\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.966523700000002;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.57237719999999;s:7:\"address\";s:48:\"XH8C+JX2, Urdaneta City, Pangasinan, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:10:\"restaurant\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:2;s:7:\"reviews\";i:2;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:476:\"places/ChIJ