d other eatery or Jollibee is  walking distance i recommend diane eatery for lutong bahay food they have freshly cook food especially chopsuey.\nThe staff are very friendly and nice i experienced that i ran out of bottle water in the middle of the night like 2am all the store is close only 711 is open but im not in the mood to walk kuya nigh shift offered me a glass of water but im just disappointed the smell of the restroom or the toilet  is not a clean looking . But its ok can handle\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-04-24T16:02:07.242829Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Jay Zapata\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWS5lxECOTj7_hI9iSoM_KYr-9i5QMylkWdHUvEGdBc3-D_8bIr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:361:\"I stayed here with my 3 kids during my grandma\'s wake and funeral. The place is not that fancy but  the staff were accommodating. They allowed us to stay in the only available room that time with a queen sized bed and did not charge for the extra head count. Good place to stay in a provinve like Camiling.\n\nPls. like if this review was helpful to you.  Thanks!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2018-11-21T05:51:26.219395197Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Trevor Gray\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLuC-xyejgDMFFrflASAT379KxbFhfR3nG7jZ-QIl4fRtZdKg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:157:\"Good location easy to walk to everything large rooms makes travling easier. Bakery at entrance is some of the best and freshest we have come across generous.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-10-18T00:57:41.723492Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1788952187),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_search_acedc3996976d26d26245511fe8f3532_15.693_120.415','a:1:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJw9l3IWKzljMReE1iYQDxYP4\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Gorospe\'s Piz