-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:376:\"We ordered a pizza -overload and it was yummy!\nThe crust was soft like S&R pizza, tasted like Pizza Hut & Papa John\'s Pizza and the shitake mushrooms added a different flavor to it though overloaded with meats. Surprisingly Good!\n\nNot so budget friendly (for solo rather best for groups) and biggest size was good for 4-6pax.\n\nI wanna taste what\'s in their menu?\n\nTry it guys!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2020-04-13T02:40:47.149612Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Giles Castillo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISypZDtQKL78ZedtANXQfFA_L0TcuZ4bSgeLQrsxsarLgebw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:188:\"Looking for a place where u can escape from ur stressful day? This place is a must try. It caters the best pizza in town which can be perfectlly paired with beers and bonding with friends.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2018-10-12T14:47:11.710513Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Jerick Dizon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXBZAitfcZY46JJ3_7KQ7UIQmGrUDMSf1ZfMrb7js269UDgCQPx=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:71:\"Cozy place to chill, have drinks and experience the best pizza in town.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-02-11T01:31:16.780668Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"JOHN CARLO LIMOS\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXXf0uncn36tioF6LkLZmKAb-ILmGeA3n7k3iJkMHhI_D9Q8_ey=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:53:\"pizza is amazing, its one of the best in camiling :-)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2019-03-07T06:10:39.092035Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Ricky King\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL_-bBqoBXrhP24Lx0KLCs_xIYGatQqewAvuC5nYM6IuD9N5Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\