";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:27:\"Nestor Bruzo Rosero Channel\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIC801YXl9Qi-29sKaOn34lcbqztD7zqyoQZFyFh9MzzBlacUY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:19:\"Affordable gasoline\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-03-25T13:37:12.098036Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"JK Reyes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXNtuxNY3jFM7umLeCGNNOqAsrRRfTreSF2_Yz_2GiFH7iHpls=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:666:\"I hope you can talk to the manager. Your guard is so rude. The gas station is noisy 24 hours a day, right? We just got home at 3am today. Besides, he\'s always noisy like that. Mom and I have been waking him up for a long time. I got angry and threw him out. I understand that it\'s already 3am, but that\'s what he came to do, if he doesn\'t want his sleep to be disturbed, why hasn\'t he quit yet? We need a super stove for what we sell. Mom cooks all night but that guard doesn\'t complain, he\'s still a man. The 215 gas for the super stove, he even increased it to 230. I\'m buying from him, and suddenly the super stove really goes up. I hope they take action on that.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-02-28T19:12:02.003784Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:2;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJb-DQyzzLljMRqjxXBmkILRs\";s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Dexstar Mktg.\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6521788;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.58579869999998;s:7:\"address\";s:28:\"Paniqui, Tarlac, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";N;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:0;s:7:\"reviews\";i:0;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:0:{}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:3;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJCQqYAwA1kTMRF_KgDq326i0\";s:4:\"name\";s:45:\"Cen