ioVRhw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:175:\"We often get our fuel here before heading to Manila because of better rates. They accept credit cards as mode of payment. Near Pura TPLEX. There is a convenience store nearby.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:24:\"2017-10-16T17:50:13.635Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Hector Villanueva\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7BVruIR7MExdagftXVvrNIFiX1qu9E_ngxXhrLUkU1CiK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:172:\"Polite & attentive attendants.  Fuel prices are very competitive.  Facilities in need of better maintenance as it is already dated.   We always gas up here whenever we can.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-18T01:38:28.819620Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jayson Salvador\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVr_KwREXwDq2cUQhIiG-mpM7AwQFJ2JhhguPbgjpWfmBR5_ukV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:83:\"Good for fueling up and stop over for your journey.  With 7-11 and bdo bank beside.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-01-24T23:11:04.042037Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"jayken nucum\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaUnUQ0pjb74p9xxAFCCh9ZsOh5amAycU-dbNTFbVI2hHsXu0ChQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:159:\"Attendants always offer extra like tire check and wind shield cleaning. Card transaction is also available. Convenient station and location is near to a hotel.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-07-21T13:17:36.067815Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:11:\"Roger Rasos\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX37v7K3CxG6wQGzt51l-ye13nZd55x9aCCt_-Dxleo2MSzbM-D=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:47:\"Nice location\nRestrooms are not that