o0pHBSQoZH_woCXVCUQQvWtP1XP8yD7WWFb180iVVNbVi5z83NAiB7xHVsKxK7xHA9fd0CQQtxTzGLpvEP76_0085CqpJDlzMs_7M6wnjvRVXXVPcj1uAdo-Z9naj1Nd4BNP8OxeTHemY6wdxIQf63fOKxTq7_tYW0fyfzB4i16otPmi7NUV0_2o1GBOAhJmkGm7cfAIWRNTKdUJJikYrNUrVNXK4qiZwkMOLu6ZU4-7FzeahwH2ZQSFzTjZYMtsMsasIFmcNPdq4GN49yEz3Vzkh26iZs5cVLUdAN0S056MS4fhdo2RapseJjYSPDr-GHZXn92mjjWiaw8qVMqtl6drr9EO-pH3IyMq8FziIQ6i1lHds9Yybgc3KzWzfsyG-gWnsHz5m6VpE-15hzZCxVrgy4FgoSAgsKT1-6zHA\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"mleonacarrie\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcvzqadE_qxO6CvPjCZvoqWWku6fMUjG6PQaqkSQ-Ta34PrD23=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:807:\"Shell Mobility at TPLEX Rosario is a very convenient and reliable stopover, especially for long drives. One thing I really appreciate is that they have an EV charger available, which is a big plus for travelers with electric vehicles.\n\nThe staff, both at the gas station and inside Shell Select, are very accommodating and attentive. The store itself is clean, well-organized, and well-stocked. Their comfort rooms are also clean and well-maintained, which is always important when stopping during a trip.\n\nAnother good thing about this location is the selection of fast food available, making it easy to grab a quick meal or snack before getting back on the road. Overall, it’s a comfortable and practical place to rest, refuel, and recharge.\n\nHighly recommended as a stopover when traveling along TPLEX.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-21T12:08:33.096401656Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Pamela L. Reyes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU6o_fgnK9KX8yaVCWGAuEMUrSw1VUzZPA-0EyzGfRMdLxYLzVS=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:184:\"Honestly the best gas station restroom ive tried! They keep it clean and filled with toilet paper and soap. Plus points kasi lots of food options inside like Potato Corner and bacsilog\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-16T07:16:59.885354284Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"Richard A Francisco\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKB3RUhFLtt7ImosmwoSu6nunMGPyPyAxwHXozmwk8SfivDzjhcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:396:\"Shell is a Dutch multinational fuel company and this branch is located near the roundabout that forms the intersection for the roads going to Rosario, Baguio, Sison and TPLEX.\n\nThis branch sells diesel and gas but also has a recharge station for EVs. They also have a large convenience store that has several food stalls inside as well as the toilet. Shell is known for maintaining clean toilets.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-13T14:18:34.087714021Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:5:\"Sam R\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1QUzdmLtCF_eZyHTPNmckMHCBtBAbUqEB9Q73xUOErZCtQdM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:876:\"A road warrior\'s Mecca. The ultimate travel center on the road to Baguio. They\'ve got everything to recharge you, your vehicle, and your travel experience. First time I\'ve ever seen a Shell Café which is akin to Starbucks Shell style. There\'s every single snack you\'d need to power your trip up the mountains or back to Manila.\n\nWhen we arrived off the TPLEX, this brand-new ultimate Shell station was bustling with travelers from North and South. I was amazed by the offerings inside from snacks to souvenirs, to electric vehicle charging, bill payments, and mini eateries like Potato Corner, Bacsilog, Pepa Wings, and Chatime milk tea. It really has everything.\n\nWe were able to eat snacks inside, buy drinks for the road, rest and relax, and refuel our vehicle before heading back to the highway. This travel center reminds me of the massive Love\'s Truck Stops in America.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-04-17T04:37:44.756718Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Lito Magbujos\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXwHVatE3cvzut5PYETw0uOhvdA4VBnSj9df4-ciWvVUPQlrPFIBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:224:\"Stop at this place to rest when you are driving and passed by this place. The toilet is very clean. There is also variety of snacks to choose from. Very relaxing. The place also has a chanrging station for electric vehicles.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-08-19T14:26:52.430770Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:19;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJeXRnwOpzkTMRPYwflzobLU8\";s:4:\"name\";s:22:\"Dg pelayo fuel station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.2599985;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.49440759999999;s:7:\"address\";s:56:\"7F5V+XQV, San Luis Bridge I, Pugo, La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:5:\"hotel\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.4;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:7;s:7:\"reviews\";i:7;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:478:\"places/ChIJeXRnwOpzkTMRPYwflzobLU8/photos/AVoNoXSy6QxT6d71Ho5H8ySuzVDTeHYGcHzWmds7xjSaFahjBkmD0oqxwsE590xBm3J4WbwcXTAE_4S5OWdjXSptmzKtpm65Yzu-l95rkQY8-sKhgIFjjALcjEu2Is9ZZRay3fzjGRaslkFyvCZaXssjThPyVM5vYpLjdjn6dRQZAE79sqb3mxQFFM_u6KVkacn73UJ8E00mXEJVKoYBuA9Y9QLshLbW-y1yEbLg4NwDGrd1PN-fnSBj1aYsM6RbTfwm15IlWAepWTb2e1iAz2YYHguNk4ioFbSIYgglXPbHTsnUJDlpuxePmy6_oYbJI_Ku17ivenS4SXIj5JJRKc0quyCKbwXXtpaYzOsgqM3GanHiL0lWa4GEPmShW3MGuTD_OyMxX3FZnuTKBKW0I1deBCXOOLHhcnhATIy6xGfttCFaGMdZ\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:1:{i:0;s:478:\"places/ChIJeXRnwOpzkTMRPYwflzobLU8/photos/AVoNoXSy6QxT6d71Ho5H8ySuzVDTeHYGcHzWmds7xjSaFahjBkmD0oqxwsE590xBm3J4WbwcXTAE_4S5OWdjXSptmzKtpm65Yzu-l95rkQY8-sKhgIFjjALcjEu2Is9ZZRay3fzjGRaslkFyvCZaXssjThPyVM5vYpLjdjn6dRQZAE79sqb3mxQFFM_u6KVkacn73UJ8E00mXEJVKoYBuA9Y9QLshLbW-y1yEbLg4NwDGrd1PN-fnSBj1aYsM6RbTfwm15IlWAepWTb2e1iAz2YYHguNk4ioFbSIYgglXPbHTsnUJDlpuxePmy6_oYbJI_Ku17ivenS4SXIj5JJRKc0quyCKbwXXtpaYzOsgqM3Ga