yqpheuOxYQpNCXBepDgmEteEUWPrc-y-xf5oz-dfvQWHa_stvKvfqPXATvE0yioHLgxrq0jylgKQ9EJ2FHr1LElw6ikUPhXYO-3SL7ot699Cn-mO9K3Fsi0jtXj3kDpX0AxMlPKzz7GViDBfRjq7VWnCl_84dR6SXRGo2BS74ctKFwQTYFvqSngYBd-nj_21IVOgnX8_nsZxLOhuvUaL9XwLLO3ucr3wfeBRBqjJYADnGpyT3LwMjHOsTXhByBfZlI1KtcFGFUEEE2NFs2g2C-nfYhIUtaO-FM4OSk_hi46ZfJkSanL5gtcidO3J3hrcyoYp4pwi6Tfs8BWjKjUECDKdLG3X-NejIxAMIQtw7nZ8OxjNGTkodnwXSaEn10mqlkykBfDXqheBs\";i:5;s:478:\"places/ChIJL6wpSt5zkTMRsYx1730AS9U/photos/AVoNoXRmo4ylbycAqkNhw6Lqzfpc1LNRTlvLgWL4FwPZsJG4HTRgxHz5xdeKY46SXBmF5zfXlGtaajFjk5YVfYYZLMN7nJ7Sr0_EADoEQUgSmMn0Gz21_s8e40Nx-GZ-fCLgNaMdqYOX3tGMmsQn2e2h31ktn7tl299CWxRMWdt4ffpW3OHuVZ6JG8XhCux12dU1JPxlRUQqg1clmkLzHBf9wDHHhgc9EdichEcHQugtlttSLOgAzaA8LyTNoZS3QxEm0f2mzK_ry4TrESIAsU5X7UkBW5iyb2cQF59_2fsUXv6-SCUWoj9z-7l7CwCBRjl7iA-m4Y8XpTVccQXMi01ceo1492z6EHEw6-bMNwehqRrSxhLjZJnElS50NHQ501l9_wUawStU3EyvLbSzaK9PrK3CEgCr8_eQnBy9S8Ek6WXVtU35\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:10:\"Tito Ramos\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV2kv3D0Xh-TOAMpA8AsrtivnGT5jniD_h3TEih0dWEPWCzURW8Lg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:1020:\"The Clean Fuel station at the TPLEX Rotunda in Rosario, La Union is a convenient and well-maintained pit stop for travelers. The place is spacious, organized, and true to the Clean Fuel standard — everything looks neat and well-kept. The staff are polite, prompt, and professional, making refueling quick and hassle-free.\n\nWhat stands out is the ample parking space and the variety of local eateries and food stalls surrounding the area. It’s a great spot to take a break, stretch your legs, and grab a quick meal before getting back on the road — definitely a plus for long drives.\n\nThe only downside is that restroom access is limited to Clean Fuel card members, which can be a bit inconvenient for non-members. For a major highway stop, it would be more traveler-friendly if basic facilities were open to everyone.\n\nOverall: A clean, spacious, and reliable station with excellent service and convenient nearby dining options. If not for the restroom restriction, it would easily be a top-rated stop along TPLEX.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-10-29T11:44:27.433038660Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Marc Jimenez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6hmLGEhPgJ_LScXBzsk1vagUWhEP0MqelZ40M5NpfeVDJCMHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:224:\"The washroom is clean, but you need a receipt to access it. There\'s Shakeys, Tapa King, and other food options (we went here at 6:30am, but they are closed).  The only open establishment here at that time is the korean mart.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-23T22:30:03.091978Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"Jeffrey Ramirez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWgrzqiDurXZjgWfosNQJPBmL_qEyaF6AszO28VGq3aeMl-MtlJEQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:132:\"Almost complete amenities after Tplex exit.\nBest Stop Over place to meet up after a long drive .\nMany options for restaurant at site\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-01-11T10:54:59.287860Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:6:\"T. Ang\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVK8ALQcLHHv7YedZ-7kjbEhyEfjSEQYHWthNAIMG_X8Jrewe7JAg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:140:\"Restrooms were in a really bad state during our visit, plus only Clean Fuel card members can use it. Men\'s room faucets weren\'t even working\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2022-05-16T03:33:51.155908Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Carlos Cestona\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwlghucQlYn8QJP7hvq-AY39J6GqC7sS6jMYrM6RPpyGcEwflZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:80:\"Amenities such as clean toilets and affordable fuel rates with spacious parking.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-18T09:50:13.380466743Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:19;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJQZFdA4p1kTMRzq21m-1MHMQ\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Star Fuel Station\";s:3:\"lat\";d:16.338373800000003;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.4374313;s:7:\"address\";s:67:\"8CQP+8XV, Aspiras - Palispis Hwy, Tubao, 2509 La Union, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:11:\"gas-station\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.8;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:4;s:7:\"reviews\";i:4;s:15:\"photo_reference\";N;s:16:\"photo_references\";a:0:{}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:17:\"Clarice Fernandez\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:118:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWttuQvi6VO_nQ07ty0T9ucK0ZGyvkO4K7MIqTjXoztbStPIus=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-12-10T06:47:43.768616Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Greg Parsons\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoXzCDldeqcBxfxKu1__HgbZBqIcCGvzbFirCic6lUn0H0gI94=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-10-02T10:00:04.565056Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Jason Guinyang\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:119:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJIUr6O0Bwjbf_1GfqbbUbVDwPTn8YBnv23erbVOVaPpbyo54l=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-02-02T06:40:35.285931Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"INVOKER N PUDGE\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWqDwDtHlotnxPkEPusqDmyN4sGt2nbtRbp65Wn7WpVsqYrz-LRvw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2021-02-01T23:14:43.999907Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summa