wLm6NAp1zcdvYT3yorGXWGlDXawzeRdncMPuRzvKmM5P6Sbw4RV\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Beverlyn Yague\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWT6gX5cd3QcHAfS0rZW2k-fXWN3bW5F6fLW51eMOi7oSAG-rNbmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:512:\"I visited Quiapo Church for the first time, and it was a nice experience. On Sundays, there is a Mass every hour. It\'s best to arrive early if you want to attend your preferred Mass schedule and get a seat.\nThe area was quite different from how it is often shown on television. I felt safe during my visit, and there were many nearby shops to explore. It\'s also a good place to take a walk and experience the classic atmosphere of Quiapo.\nOverall, it was an interesting visit, especially for first-time visitors.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-10T11:07:04.546443325Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Roselyn Walsh\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQG97Hwx-L7u6cJvsd3_1a1tHmL0MmMdjfoHOITlusa3S3oA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:955:\"Had such a great experience at D\'Rose Taverna! From the moment we arrived, the place already gave a relaxing and cozy vibe—perfect for unwinding with family and friends. The overlooking view is absolutely breathtaking, especially during sunset, making the whole dining experience even more special. �\nTop Rated\nThe food is truly something to look forward to. Every dish is freshly prepared and full of authentic flavors—from their biryani made with basmati rice to their must-try steaks and other Mediterranean-inspired dishes. �\nTop Rated\nWhat made it even better is the warm and accommodating staff who made sure we were comfortable the whole time. The ambiance, the delicious food, and the beautiful surroundings all come together to create a memorable dining experience. �\nRestaurant Guru\nDefinitely a place worth visiting again and again. Highly recommended if you’re looking for good food, relaxing views, and a great overall experience!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-06T07:22:48.989414344Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:8:\"Elric Hu\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXS-A-Up8ZArnq0S-aCV4Sb3Vx4B84nwxG8erho8_OsbiOKPnY-DA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:382:\"?Quiapo Church, Manila\nHome to the iconic Black Nazarene, a historic 1606 wooden icon revered by millions. Right outside is the bustling Quiapo Market—perfect for local vibes, but keep your bags close as pickpocketers operate in the thick crowds! ?✨\n\nYou can arrive there by the local LRT system, remember to get off at Carriedo station and it’s about 7 minutes by foot.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-25T21:31:11.980257351Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"maricel Herrera\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJI4mpE5qLrzLvlW9Lr83SeqIJmlmzKwE9CsVeJPYmqyMC7jEo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:474:\"The holy  Church of Miracle\nThe Power of faith  church\nThe heaven place in Earth\'s full of amazing and wonderful hystory of answers prayer ? real miracle healing ?\nSelf witnessing the Miracle healing\nTo risk life to total heal documentary on medical doctor\nQuiapo Church were my parent\'s wil wish and  pray to have a daughter I am\nIndeed I\'m belong to this church and alive in miracles\nGlory to God to the highest spirit of the lord of Lords Quiapo church ???\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-22T06:22:16.188447373Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Robert Gudyk\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUprd3yQmjHS46CYGOt-nPJCAujGrtNyyPYjEudOGGSxqb2g-4dLQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:245:\"A very historic place that has a deep cultural heritage in Manila. If you are Catholic or Christian in general this place is a great place to worship. The surrounding area is very congested and watch for cellphone snatchers. Beautiful experience\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-03T01:14:46.503303127Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:92:\"Catholic church containing a revered 17th-century statue of Jesus called the Black Nazarene.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:1;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJW0g7XVHJlzMR-Mr-D2p4jeI\";s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Baclaran Church\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.5316943;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.99431759999999;s:7:\"address\";s:71:\"Redemptorist Road, Baclaran, Parañaque, Kalakhang Maynila, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.7;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:12873;s:7:\"reviews\";i:12873;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJW0g7XVHJlzMR-Mr-D2p4jeI/photos/AVoNoXSe1juZRPR1X_E-GCeGWAanCd88tAw-VHipIJrJfsjnWEdb_J-FjayYFz06tm7abeju8WSajVflDwnrqJ6sYUUZfVXA8WZh4tlUKY-ebYX8VarlHL06zCUUzCU8-AxuMvVTC3_g8lGmb4eNKPsECDIRx6Cioy63Ro0ZqhI_uEK8k2Ely8gOfQDuhZUk3xxyF-8VRVotbSn8gGtR5FKhrYXu27qguLbWsyxBwWlsD6dKqd8uQvmUdOtos0T967YxQPPgpZAuGABAV2yZf0ATalrxDZqjAI64h9qzasqTx6ps32QVNzV594URLClCY-8ZfXFvYsaysPc4OdAhCGCBiP2j338vVtX3GItyKD2Avr2BrxiBX4oqLpFuiY2NOSQsV6eL2l5UV-BfqZMgKkIkBuXFNxsJf42iF_yWVQKs3UtPiH-vaDvQ69jmAtwM2l-h\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJW0g7XVHJlzMR-Mr-D2p4jeI/photos/AVoNoXSe1juZRPR1X_E-GCeGWAanCd88tAw-VHipIJrJfsjnWEdb_J-FjayYFz06tm7abeju8WSajVflDwnrqJ6sYUUZfVXA8WZh4tlUKY-ebYX8VarlHL06zCUUzCU8-AxuMvVTC3_g8lGmb4eNKPsECDIRx6Cioy63Ro0ZqhI_uEK8k2Ely8gOfQDuhZUk3xxyF-8VRVotbSn8gGtR5FKhrYXu27qguLbWsyxBwWlsD6dKqd8uQvmUdOtos0T967YxQPPgpZAuGABAV2yZf0ATalrxDZqjAI64h9qzasqTx6ps32QVNzV594URLClCY-8ZfXFvYsaysPc4OdAhCGCBiP2j338vVtX3GItyKD2Avr2BrxiBX4oqLpFuiY2NOSQsV6eL2l5UV-BfqZMgKkIkBuXFNxsJf42iF_yWVQKs3UtPiH-vaDvQ69jmAtwM2l-h\";i:1;s:478:\"places/ChIJW0g7XVHJlzMR-Mr-D2p4jeI/photos/AVoNoXTVP1HbCVsbfhgoiyOzibsE6YkzwRfB9cd7b3y