 park feels like a breath of fresh air amidst the towering corporate skyscrapers of the Makati Central Business District.\nWhether you are a local office worker looking to decompress, an avid runner, or a tourist exploring the city, this beautifully manicured urban oasis has something special for everyone.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-18T04:07:27.677668980Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Jared Bender\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWj-yD3BvYJpSw81CmxLTq2OPiDM4u2w8otNZaGucKXX4bWKGnjBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:632:\"? One of My Most Favorite Places in Makati!!\nI’ve been here many many times and it never gets old! Such a special spot right in the heart of the city.\n\n? Perfect for Everything\nIt’s a great spot for night walks, picnics, and going for a bite to eat. So many great spots in this area to explore and enjoy!\n\n? Green in the Urban Jungle\nIt’s so refreshing to see so much green in the middle of an urban city! A true oasis in the heart of Makati.\n\n✅ Final Verdict\nHighly recommend visiting Ayala Triangle Gardens whether you’re a local or just visiting Makati. One of those places that just never disappoints! ?✨\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-11T00:06:24.086297378Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:1:\"k\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUbjDGaWnBPsASNxrXXLW2qOyt3yTU-A-TiJwHxLR0hKdzJ6q4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:591:\"Last Art Month, they held an Art Walk here at Ayala Triangle, featuring exhibits from a wide range of talented artists. It was such a wonderful experience and easily one of my favorite exhibitions in Makati.\n\nI loved being able to explore different art styles, creative perspectives, and beautifully curated displays all in one place. Events like this make art more accessible and allow more people to appreciate the incredible work of local artists.\n\nI\'m really hoping they\'ll bring it back again next year because it\'s definitely an event I\'d love to experience all over again. ?✨?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-06-04T07:02:35.983562512Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Nikolai Strecker\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhzU-V8evGyqCfphSJmg-DaJmQ-pUJHMzwD9yBtQ9aLL16DjXu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:197:\"Very lovely place to hang out in the day or after sunset.. you can have a picnic or enjoy your time at a café.. there\'s even a free library for the ones who love to read in old fashion a nice book\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-22T09:38:13.224614769Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:22:\"Earthly Eats & Escapes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzBZ7VrZq6QjWu_GtDVJXLhZGnTrMxT9t7ljt10VNb2dPhIi0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:1429:\"Ayala Triangle Gardens is truly a breath of fresh air in the middle of the busy Makati business district. ? Surrounded by tall buildings and offices, this park offers a peaceful green space where you can slow down, relax, and enjoy a bit of nature in the city.\n\nThe place is very well maintained, with wide walking paths, lots of trees, and open spaces where you can sit, stroll, or even do a quick jog. It’s a great spot for a quick break, casual meetups, or even a quiet walk after a long day. The landscaping is beautiful and the area feels clean, safe, and organized.\n\nOne thing we noticed too is the number of cats around the park. ? There are quite a lot of them, but it’s obvious they’re well taken care of—they all look healthy, well-fed, and comfortable in the area. It actually adds charm to the place, especially for animal lovers.\n\nThere’s also a play area for kids, which makes the park even more family-friendly. It’s a nice spot for parents to let their kids play while still enjoying the relaxing atmosphere of the gardens.\n\nWhat makes it even better is that there are several restaurants and cafés around the park, so it’s easy to grab a meal or coffee while enjoying the surroundings.\n\nOverall, Ayala Triangle Gardens is a wonderful urban park that balances nature and city life perfectly. Definitely worth visiting if you’re in Makati and want a calm and refreshing place to unwind. ?\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-05T17:50:41.990015734Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:90:\"Serene, triangle-shaped park with jogging paths, adjacent eateries & seasonal light shows.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:7;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJDXUM9QPKlzMRDOajr3iHEoQ\";s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Manila Ocean Park\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.5793088;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.9724475;s:7:\"address\";s:78:\"666 Behind, Quirino Grandstand, Ermita, Manila, 1000 Metro Manila, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.2;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:18296;s:7:\"reviews\";i:18296;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJDXUM9QPKlzMRDOajr3iHEoQ/photos/AVoNoXSbOnnDqJPTgD1cwGi9akPzZYDmwAqCP84Pweux6rhrlJtFmEjYyTs26t4KH7I_0TBdHpm6Tay6C8htTYc5hRUd0masEWo6pY7kY_uQl3mErWbOVbco9dnV8PiwnGp9DeRRbh6opcumQu3WsJpC3ojptqJafXdNzSurmfJfkW41nxBMF0T2UQTdR3hDnUYrOSKl9lpT8ca_j4NZ-zimupwYwYup8-enHS1IFyo_HRvTpaPUy_Ke-DN7SeXONev0NHQ4Cz4LdyGiST6MYNiic0Pp0fuB3nmobOiKEETpcduaDOt039P41DQZr9t-ZrfMgbcDfFkNxNiV-Y-bC4vuMMz-_Q_4ysJejGbp5og9KM1925ZILBo8gA3_tnZAMJ-sjZaynpASE_Y-uHu2I3PcPxd7i8pmGcXaengOPripVzbF97GQ71LBvP2T8LGc40i6\";s:16:\"photo_references\";a:6:{i:0;s:494:\"places/ChIJDXUM9QPKlzMRDOajr3iHEoQ/photos/AVoNoXSbOnnDqJPTgD1cwGi9akPzZYDmwAqCP84Pweux6rhrlJtFmEjYyTs26t4KH7I_0TBdHpm6Tay6C8htTYc5hRUd0masEWo6pY7kY_uQl3mErWbOVbco9dnV8PiwnGp9DeRRbh6opcumQu3WsJpC3ojptqJafXdNzSurmfJfkW41nxBMF0T2UQTdR3hDnUYrOSKl9lpT8ca_j4NZ-zimupwYwYup8-enHS1IFyo_HRvTpaPUy_Ke-DN7SeXONev0NHQ4Cz4LdyGiST6MYNiic0Pp0fuB3nmobO