SIeSaSRdARfrlnqACdSxkzMsXG7Cw2pKl0mK7jFePkwJzpTczErTgkUWn7EWvZ7HHp6TtaZrNkppwiRoe3c68u8P1UtSXpF7XnMM1RCsnJEk4sbO93O41SOaRgNUKYkSDmocwdE-A\";i:5;s:478:\"places/ChIJDXUM9QPKlzMRDOajr3iHEoQ/photos/AVoNoXRWK6XbeQLLcO4GKJ-8uWzjOM2yqgi1DrnLt64NfC_AJQdRjXTXaMrGbmoPTP6ZzebT9Xiame1DmEGTklHGSCf0mDGWXZ7z4gUU_x2dlvr9roty4PPnn3FNQs6R8mnIyxJo3IMK69NKcjcC_QKgJPSN0IAcoPDYVtr5zmKshiOV6GwoPR8wt0UGVdy2_5le6DSQ8zhmGKQGspksiH5ihnsZktDuqm6TPl7ImhS_FLi9P0CG4U7wchn1lqP-HuzNmIVgJQFfnZfLhOxueU5MUfKYApu9EX00nE7BIUhRdg-o647WCu7qAu49O0q-tBASX8mC5m2twD6wGBlmHdumjKbt6Dzu56-vimP9SyWSqdyX_bgbhlULhhL0jF5k9-qT-OhryHhPbjZwmB1ikVk3IGKGEPEITW2DsiOCs9G3Bd5MbjyS\";}s:12:\"reviews_data\";a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Marcus Olson\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVs-RFFYzGyifQIoJhf7FbRl0fLV91xVCFLyPMuJMbxSpJe_s-M=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:205:\"Great place.\nLoved the exhibitions and the good aquariums.\nMany different fishes,sharks,corals etc.\nThey do have live feedings sometimes.\nCould get crowded in weekends so buy in advance can be recommended.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-25T04:05:17.172085334Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"Jennifer Inocentes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWIeeZAzQJG5xJodxR_gxMcrLvEeC6stWDQfrzWeRpRt5i6NJs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:666:\"We had a wonderful experience at Manila Ocean Park! It\'s a great destination for families, couples, and kids who want to learn more about marine life while having fun.\n\nThe aquarium exhibits are beautiful and well-maintained, with a wide variety of sea creatures to see. The Oceanarium tunnel is definitely one of the highlights, and the animal shows are entertaining and enjoyable.\n\nThe park is clean, the staff are friendly and accommodating, and there are plenty of attractions to explore. It\'s a perfect place to spend quality time with family and create unforgettable memories.\n\nHighly recommended if you\'re looking for a fun and educational day trip in Manila!\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-04T13:30:20.995429714Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"alan fernandes\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVvZ2CQ_CVfut_QZyFahgK2oFkbuf8a-6_qXMer_ARLK7cUBSU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:576:\"I had an absolutely wonderful time at this place. It is truly an excellent destination to enjoy with your family, offering a wide variety of attractions. The ticket price is well worth it, as you can see a vast array of fish, reptiles, insects, penguins, and birds. It takes about a full day to explore all the exhibits thoroughly, ensuring you get the most out of your visit. Additionally, they offer live shows featuring birds and seals, which was entertaining. Overall, it was a fantastic experience that I highly recommend to anyone looking for a fun and engaging day out.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-03T17:00:38.136270103Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Rosemarie Ylanan\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:121:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIoaXbUvjDEzV4xhHJsPsYjAWliLLjoPqLud-5Cy68C8ueDJaY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:843:\"I visited Manila Ocean Park expecting a bit more, but it ended up being just okay. There are plenty of fish and marine animals to see, but I found the aquarium exhibits a bit underwhelming compared to what I had imagined. If you\'ve been to larger aquariums before, this one might not feel as impressive.\n\nThat said, the bird show and the sea lion show were definitely the highlights of the visit! They were entertaining, interactive, and made the trip much more enjoyable. The staff and trainers did a great job, and those shows were worth watching.\n\nOverall, it\'s a decent place to visit at least once, especially if you\'re bringing kids or haven\'t been to an ocean park before. Just keep your expectations realistic if you\'re mainly going for the aquarium exhibits.\n\ntips: buy tickets from online apps like klook or stardeal for discount. :)\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-06T02:28:04.032272420Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Melissa Buzabo\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIV2L7tNFcoHLeHWWI_T1RQvO9531lXld2IYLRBJBOz2D-FGw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:340:\"It was a really amazing experience, the shows were great. There were so many different sea creatures and a huge crocodile plus really cute penguins, it’s Christmas all year round at the ocean park. Loved it!!!!!\n\nPS: buy tickets online so that you don’t have to wait. The ticket gets you access to everything in the park, it’s awesome\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-07-12T10:31:01.966360007Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";s:100:\"Aquatic theme park & educational facility featuring hands-on activities, an oceanarium & live shows.\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:8;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJ1abFKYXLlzMRLFUriVPw1cs\";s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"Pasig River Esplanade\";s:3:\"lat\";d:14.595854699999999;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.97836449999998;s:7:\"address\";s:70:\"448, 1000 Riverside Dr, Ermita, Manila, 1000 Metro Manila, Philippines\";s:8:\"category\";s:12:\"google_place\";s:4:\"type\";s:8:\"landmark\";s:6:\"rating\";d:4.5;s:18:\"user_ratings_total\";i:748;s:7:\"reviews\";i:748;s:15:\"photo_reference\";s:494:\"places/ChIJ1abFKYXLlzMRLFUriVPw1cs/photos/AVoNoXQ7BWLzMnxFDyJQQT5RW0IUDxDjZQPtGNpRv7sm_xp1f5luP1dcz2x64jb8WgdTzUOaVFm2FmHhCu2XcWgxwpN02dAHuIUUjCGO_1S_yRCIdmfP0bhKOQ_IFfyidBVTxebFRmxCdu9_AQ-9Dnv-ZH99wd60Df5qZTZNRifTHZbEYAOygBaQt21UEHocfxQhfzPhYtx-97lCNU0xdCUA-X4Kt3ntXHOBJOdIPIqTNMYLOObKzsJH_QJxdjmYnk6bZbrzvzVUo_-HOy3sgEi2uf9s4HUtK3_XxzufqpgECugWc4rw8eImVut1aiK5IRbxQSLM6ZdImV_lvlINkPnlJrzP_GxEigRkmvqR5N1r7jlh7bhM2Lu3ddU_I158wzidvZAA