t.com/a-/ALV-UjWovuN62FPZoZrkHCR0ECJvYBSDE76XiKJNPDcDlhWC8fX9L1uuDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:1;s:4:\"text\";s:231:\"This is not a public park anymore since the gates have been closed for a long time. I remember playing here when I was a child. If there’s at least one person assigned for its maintenance then I think people can enjoy this place.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2024-03-30T00:50:36.172347Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:14:\"Nicolas Flores\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUAn7ZM_DXRfF3VK12crKZRjU1tkNHt10hgyZRtpkVUgHrKnDn3=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:312:\"The center of North and South from Central Luzon entrance Metro Manila, though busy area, it manages travellers and commuters theeir choices of means of transportation. The Cloverleaf Ayala Mall became the ultimate hang out of the passersby the  bus bay area, jeepney stop and TNVS provides comfort to commuters.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2025-01-24T11:08:32.323225Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:12:\"Kiko machine\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW46N7PlyKKc9j5gs0fOCWmc0xG_N7B1Ble3FtSEgxfGRxa5fo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:3;s:4:\"text\";s:23:\"Visited chuch.very old.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-03-23T03:53:57.927954729Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:16:\"Ivan Rainier Chu\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIWP4nezcg1nNhr0taqX3bwKRhOHlkfGs64goA-ZFNRpbh6Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:127:\"Well traffic in that area is quite bad... So before you get there, a lot of time has been consumed. But I love Cloverleaf Park.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:27:\"2023-06-15T03:52:01.497490Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}i:19;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJd0WbxXTLlz