yXL1EGlTZPomQYX8poXuiZly=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:250:\"The entire baywalk area is excellent and refreshing, especially for morning walks. By evening, it transforms into a lively food hub with numerous restaurants offering a wide variety of options. There are also plenty of spaces and activities for kids.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-05-05T18:21:34.044217404Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:1;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Kaung Lin Kyi\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:123:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaVx-DDUaB_5YbAAFV3Pznk6-xYmGJfIH0si41ofNQeBbfwu3r=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:191:\"Beautiful area to walk around and enjoy the sea breeze. Lots of restaurants and snack shops around as well! Cleanliness can be better though. People need to stop throwing trash over the wall.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-14T15:18:58.840245382Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:2;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"JLo Sedon\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5miaNDMVssEZKjuJV8-i-eIyM08nA-0CLnKY-e37uEAlVwr7j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:1075:\"SM Mall of Asia dominated New Year’s Eve celebrations as it hosted the GMA Kapuso Countdown to 2026, drawing over 250,000 Filipinos and tourists to the seaside complex. Crowds filled Seaside Boulevard and key activity areas across the complex as live performances kicked off at 10 PM on December 31.\n\nThe event was hosted by Betong Sumaya, Christian Bautista, Tim Yap, and Emma Tiglao, keeping the energy high throughout the evening. Artists who took the stage included Julie Anne San Jose, Rayver Cruz, Will Ashley, Vince Maristela, Faith da Silva, Angel Guardian, Charlie Fleming, AZ Martinez, international singer Bonnie Bailey, and other GMA Kapuso stars, drawing cheers from the massive crowd spread across the MOA grounds.\n\nThe night’s biggest highlight came with the performance of K-pop sensation AHOF. With Filipino member JL Gaspar in its lineup, AHOF’s set resonated strongly with local fans gathered at MOA to welcome 2026. The GMA Kapuso Countdown to 2026 underscored SM Mall of Asia’s continued ability to deliver large-scale, high-impact public events.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-01-01T09:44:01.999349533Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:3;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:19:\"TheFilipinoExplorer\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:122:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVSItznMLP5ziynG6-oQKYu-qgokaG6bwm8nEbH57fjPmhxNic=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:387:\"Seaside at Mall of Asia is one of the best places to unwind in Metro Manila. The view of Manila Bay is relaxing, and the sunset is absolutely beautiful. The sky turns orange and pink, making it perfect for photos and quiet moments. There are plenty of restaurants to choose from, and the sea breeze makes evening walks even more enjoyable. A great spot to chill, eat, and enjoy the view.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2026-02-14T11:04:59.893846153Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}i:4;a:6:{s:6:\"author\";s:13:\"Twinkle Raven\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:125:\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWJ0Dattg2hLQ2V-y3WAlqewHJz0rHJTisXfEMpbDIv_NW-U3d-tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:243:\"Perfect place to relax and unwind. The only downside of this place is that this side of the Moa seaside doesn\'t have any ATM machines. So you better have a cash on hand ready, though some establishments like 7-Eleven accepts gcash as payments.\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:30:\"2025-07-27T09:21:38.231872665Z\";s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"Google\";}}s:17:\"editorial_summary\";N;s:6:\"source\";s:6:\"google\";}}',1789098833),('laravel-cache-rapidapi_tourist_attraction_15.641_120.428','a:20:{i:0;a:15:{s:2:\"id\";s:27:\"ChIJyfWtgr-1ljMR1hWQhPpR_40\";s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Santa Ignacia People\'s Park\";s:3:\"lat\";d:15.6142053;s:3:\"lng\";d:120.43394479999999;s:7:\"address\";s:50:\"Poblacion West, Santa